id: SCA-049
title: Dockerfile ADD with remote URL
category: supply-chain
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: Dockerfile
  extensions: .dockerfile
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: ^ADD\s+https?://
    message: ADD fetches remote URLs at build time and auto-extracts archives. An attacker who compromises the URL serves malicious content.
fix: Use COPY with a separate RUN curl that verifies checksums. Or use multi-stage builds with ADD --checksum=sha256:<hash> (BuildKit).
